        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 819SCE, San Clemente Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern square styled design, the Kwikset San Clemente Dummy Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Kwikset Dummy San Clemente Handleset is not functional as it neither latches nor locks; it is most often used on the inactive side of double doors as a pull to match trim. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-SH223-specifications.gif?v=1704354650\" width\"450\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Kwikset San Clemente Dummy Handleset Specifications\">\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-san-clemente-handleset-kwikset-818sce\"><b>Single Cylinder San Clemente Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications & Features</b> for the Kwikset San Clemente Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 13-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: Adjustable, Min: 8-13/32 - Max: 9-11/16</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed, Reversible for Left or Right handing</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "San Clemente Dummy Handleset, Kwikset 819SCE",
                "description": "Kwikset 819SCE - Modern square styled design, the Kwikset San Clemente Dummy Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Kwikset Dummy San Clemente Handleset is not functional as it neither latches nor locks; it is most often used on the inactive side of double doors as a pull to match trim. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty the San Clemente handle is available in 5 color options.",
